* PVCELL VDMOS C_gd fit for B3M040120Z: drain ramp 0..800 V, gate held at -4.0 V
.model m VDMOS(Vto=2.7 Kp=3.2 lambda=0.01 Rd=0.01858 Rs=0.5m Rg=1.3 Cgs=1.864e-09 Cgdmax=3.74e-10 Cgdmin=6e-12 a=0.01395 Cjo=1.243e-09 Vj=3 M=0.5 Is=7.58e-16 N=3 Rb=0.1034 Tt=0)
Vg g 0 -4.0
Vd dd 0 PWL(0 0 10u 800.0)
Rd dd dn 1m
M1 dn g 0 m
.save i(Vg) v(dn)
.tran 5n 10u
.control
run
wrdata pv_fit_B3M040120Z.dat i(Vg) v(dn)
quit
.endc
.end
